    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-3 border-t border-ink/10 pt-6 text-xs text-stone md:flex-row">
      <span>&copy; {year} Signal Advisory LLC. Kansas City, Missouri. Serving clients nationwide.</span>
      <span class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
